{"id": "9-908", "question": "When a kid slams on the brakes on their bike what is caused?", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): bike helmet", "B): avoiding accidents", "C): friction", "D): gearing"], "correct": "C", "initial_cot": "1. When a kid slams on the brakes on their bike, the primary action is the application of force to the brake pads.\n2. This force causes the brake pads to press against the wheel's rim or disc, creating resistance.\n3. The resistance is due to the force of friction between the brake pads and the wheel.\n4. Friction is the force that opposes the motion of two surfaces in contact.\n5. In this case, the friction between the brake pads and the wheel slows down the bike.", "initial_cot_probs": [2.3349548960993616e-09, 2.645850649685144e-09, 1.8920334696304053e-05, 6.689757636735294e-10], "initial_probs": [1.7200418369611725e-06, 9.898157259158324e-06, 0.0004208803584333509, 1.7200418369611725e-06], "prediction": 2, "cot_prediction": 2, "rt_lambda": 1.0, "cot_step": "When a kid slams on the brakes on their bike, the primary action is the application of force to the brake pads.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "When a kid slams on the brakes on their bike, the primary action is the application of force to the brake pads.", "2.", "This force causes the brake pads to press against the wheel's rim or disc, creating resistance.", "3.", "The resistance is due to the force of friction between the brake pads and the wheel.", "4.", "Friction is the force that opposes the motion of two surfaces in contact.", "5.", "In this case, the friction between the brake pads and the wheel slows down the bike."], "unlearning_results": {"0": {"completion": "C). When a kid slams on the bra", "probs": [1.7200418369611725e-06, 9.898157259158324e-06, 0.0004208803584333509, 1.7200418369611725e-06], "prediction": 2, "target_cot_step": "When a kid slams on the brakes on their bike, the primary action is the application of force to the brake pads.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Qu